    "body": "Parent: #229 / #228\n\nImplements the first executable pre-render slice from `ZORR_REFERENCE_TO_DRAWING_ENGINE_MATH.md`.\n\nScope:\n- OpenCV/NumPy only; no diffusion, renderer, image generation, or image editing.\n- Emits deterministic structure-state JSON + NPZ evidence layers.\n- Keeps semantic anatomy and occlusion fail-closed (`PARTIAL` / `UNKNOWN`) rather than inventing hidden facts.\n- Per-run epsilon/tone/color parameters are explicit and recorded; no universal thresholds.\n\nFresh exact-byte verification is persisted in `agent-controller/REFERENCE_ANALYSIS_R01_EVIDENCE.md`.\n\nExact candidate evidence:\n- `reference_analysis.py` blob `1472fae4f9017bbf1f99b9cfcde7aeabd12d5b13`;\n- `test_reference_analysis.py` blob `3773e27380342a86adbfdbe9ddeac85efbb7523a`;\n- 5 tests pass on those exact source/test bytes;\n- repeated identical `1 Гаммот.png` input/parameters gives byte-identical JSON + NPZ in the executed runtime;\n- three existing character references complete structure-state execution.\n\nLayer truth:\n- L0/L1/L2 PASS;\n- L3/L4/L5/L6/L8/L9/L10 PARTIAL;\n- L7 UNKNOWN;\n- renderer NOT_STARTED.\n\nL3 fail-closed repair:\n- all three PNG alpha channels are fully opaque and therefore not silhouette authority;\n- Otsu/Triangle foreground intersection is conservative visible evidence;\n- their 2.39%–7.06% disagreement is emitted as UNKNOWN, not promoted to geometry;\n- L3 remains PARTIAL because no independent ground-truth mask/acceptance threshold exists.\n\nA prior repeat-run determinism defect in `cv2.magnitude` was isolated to `L2_gradient_strength` and repaired with the contract formula `sqrt(Gx^2 + Gy^2)` while retaining OpenCV Scharr as derivative authority.\n\nThis PR remains intentionally draft. MERGE / CANON / PRODUCTION activation are not authorized by this slice.",
